   "subject": "Validation of ZANB model with random effect",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Hi all,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">I am\r\ntrying to validate a ZANB model with random factor (ID) for count data with excess\r\nof zeros.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Following Zuur (2017), before to combine them I’ve got the\r\nposterior mean values for each model: 1) mod01(Bernoulli for presence/absence\r\ndata)  and 2) mod.pos (truncated negative binomial model for non-zero\r\ndata). But I’ve got error message (it can’t find ID). Could you help me to\r\nidentify the error</span>? How do I have to include the random component in\r\nthe code?</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Below I\r\ncopy the code</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif\">---------------------------------</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">X &lt;- model.matrix(~ var1 + var2 + var3, data = data) #covariate\r\nmatrix</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">X &lt;- as.matrix(X)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Beta01 &lt;- mod01$summary.fixed[, &quot;mean&quot;] </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">r01 &lt;- mod01$summary.random$ID$mean</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Pi &lt;- exp(X %*% Beta01 + ID %*% r01)/(1 + exp(X %*% Bet01 + ID\r\n%*% r01))</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Beta.Pos &lt;- mod.pos$summary.fixed[, &quot;mean&quot;]</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">rPos &lt;- mod.pos$summary.random$ID$mean</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">k       &lt;- mod.pos$summary.hyper[1,&quot;mean&quot;]</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">mu &lt;- exp(X %*% Beta.Pos + ID %*% rPos)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">P0 &lt;- (k / (mu + k))^k</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">muZANB &lt;- (Pi / (1 - P0)) \r\n* mu</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:1pt solid windowtext;padding:0cm 0cm 1pt\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"border:none;padding:0cm;margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">varZANB &lt;- (Pi / (1 - P0)) * (mu^2\r\n+ mu + mu^2 / k ) - (Pi / (1 - P0) * mu)^2</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Thank you\r\nin advance for your help</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Regards</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Barbara</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;line-height:115%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><div><br></div></div>\r\n"
